  token: {{amakaJwt}}
}

assert {
  res.status: eq 200
}

docs {
  # I want to see all my own listings on a "My Listings" page like I would
  # on Jiji or Property24. My persona doc says this should exist.

  🚫 EXPECTED-MISSING: There is no `GET /listings/mine` in the spec. I have
  no way to fetch JUST my own listings as the authenticated owner. My
  options to see my listing again are: remember the ID, OR scroll the
  PUBLIC listings page until I find it. That's not acceptable for a
  property-management tool.

  Same for properties — no `GET /properties/mine`. I'm flying blind.
}
